OpenCC lexicons (https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC), Copyright OpenCC
contributors, Apache License 2.0, and a vendored jieba-rs
(https://github.com/messense/jieba-rs), Copyright (c) 2018-2019 messense and
Paul Meng, MIT License, with the jieba word dictionary
(https://github.com/fxsjy/jieba), Copyright (c) 2013 Sun Junyi, MIT
License. The OpenCC lexicons are repackaged compressed inside the crate and
unchanged in content. Both are compiled into the myna-desktop binary, so
they ship inside the myna snap; the licence texts are
third-party-licenses/OpenCC-Apache-2.0.txt and Jieba-MIT.txt, staged beside
this file.
